      'The Urdu word "پہنچنا" has several translations in English, depending on the context:\n\n## 1. To Reach\n\nThe most common translation of "پہنچنا" is "to reach" when referring to arriving at a destination or achieving a goal. For example:\nوقت پر پہنچنا بہت اہم ہے۔ - It is important to reach on time.\nمیں اپنے مقصد تک پہنچ گیا۔ - I have reached my destination.\n\n## 2. To Arrive\n\n"پہنچنا" can also mean "to arrive" implying reaching a particular place. For instance:\nوہ ٹرین سٹیشن پر پہنچ چکا ہے۔ - He has arrived at the train station.\nمیں گھر پہنچ گیا ہوں۔ - I have arrived home.\n\n## 3. To Attain\n\nIn certain contexts, "پہنچنا" can mean "to attain" or "to achieve" a certain status or target. For example:\nوہ اپنی منزل تک پہنچ گیا۔ - He has attained his goal.\nمجھے اپنے مقصد تک پہنچنا ہے۔ - I have to achieve my goal.\n\n## 4. To Gain Access\n\nSometimes "پہنچنا" is used to mean "to gain access" or "to reach a specific point". For instance:\nوہ بنک کے آن لائن اکاؤنٹ تک پہنچ گیا۔ - He reached the bank\'s online account.\nتمہیں اس مکان تک پہنچنا ہوگا۔ - You have to gain access to that place.\n\nTherefore, the English translations of the Urdu word "پہنچنا" can include "to reach", "to arrive", "to attain", and "to gain access", depending on the specific context in which it is used.',
